#  FISI Home Lab
Overview
This repository documents my IT learning journey as a Fachinformatiker für Systemintegration (FISI).  
It includes practical exercises and home lab setups focused on Windows Server and network administration.
## Lab Topics
- Windows Server 2022
- Active Directory Domain Services (AD DS)
- DNS Configuration
- DHCP Setup
- User & Group Management
- Virtualization (Hyper-V / VMware)
- Basic PowerShell scripting

## Purpose
The goal of this project is to gain hands-on experience in IT system administration and build real-world skills required in enterprise environments.

## Contents
- Step-by-step lab documentation
- Screenshots of configurations
- PowerShell scripts
- Network setup notes

## Tools Used
- Windows Server 2022
- Windows 10/11 Clients
- Hyper-V / VMware Workstation
- GitHub for documentation

